<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>No Recoil All guns + AUTOPING</Major>
    <Description>(EN)
Use the middle button as a mark
No recoil works for most weapons.
MARKING TUTORIAL: Go into the game settings and change the "mark enemy" button to the "middle mouse button"
RECOIL TUTORIAL: just activate it with any weapon, sometimes it can work more on one weapon than the other.
have fun. (marking enemies is pretty OVERPOWERED)
Resolution: 1920x1080
Sensitivity: 13.5
DPI: 800</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 64 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 64 ms
MoveR 0 4
Delay 64 ms
MoveR 0 3
Delay 64 ms
MiddleDown 1
Delay 100 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Call of Duty: Warzone 2.0</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>